From a3d38aac55a56edec2dd2c2bfb8cd92bad23ef34 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: zeroday0619 <escha@zeroday0619.dev>
Date: Fri, 11 Sep 2026 07:37:43 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 10/12] anubis: add scoped controls and transactional runtime
 settings

Persist the global switch and bounded challenge options in settings, and
preserve per-host choices in existing metadata. Match exact hosts before
wildcard hosts while retaining the deployed protection defaults.

Require administrator authorization, serialize changes, restore settings
after failed applies, and wait for the isolated runtime supervisor to
acknowledge healthy settings.
